    answer: 'Yes. Our San Gabriel service extends to Alhambra, Temple City, Rosemead, Monterey Park, El Monte, San Marino, and South Pasadena. All within our regular San Gabriel Valley route.'
  },
  {
    question: "What's the most common appliance repair our techs see in San Gabriel?",
    answer: 'The most common San Gabriel calls our techs at Same Day Appliance Repair handle are SGVMWD hard-water failures — LG ice maker inlet valves scaled shut and Bosch dishwasher spray arms clogged with mineral deposits — alongside Samsung front-loader DC unbalance faults from worn shock absorbers and GE oven igniters that glow but won\'t light. We check for mineral scale proactively on every relevant call. $89 residential diagnostic, waived with repair.'
  },
  {
    question: 'Are your San Gabriel appliance repairs licensed and insured?',
